WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.040
- I heard this about you,
which I think is funny

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.330
'cause it seems late in the game

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.770
to learn how to pluck your eyebrows,

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.116
but Tina Fey taught you?
(Amy laughs)

00:00:07.116 --> 00:00:07.949
- She did.

00:00:07.949 --> 00:00:09.390
- When did she did she teach
you how to pluck your eyebrows?

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:10.680
I'm like, how long have
you known each other?

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.970
- What if I was like 44?

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.160
- I was like, it seemed late in the game.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.170
Like, when did y'all
meet and this happened?

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:17.190
- We were probably, at that point,

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:21.450
we were probably touring for Second City.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.250
So I was in my twenties for sure.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.083
- Oh, okay, okay.

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:24.916
- [Amy] Yeah, I was in
my twenties for sure.

00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:25.950
- For some reason in my brain,

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:28.050
I just see y'all meeting
at 30 and you were like

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.700
so how do you do this?

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.880
- No, you know Tina and
Maya who I do baking with

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.885
and like we've all now known
each other for 25 years almost.

00:00:36.885 --> 00:00:37.980
- That's awesome.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.750
- Yeah, Rachel Dratch,
all those people I met,

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.820
but Tina and I met in
Chicago in the nineties,

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:42.810
so yeah, it must have been.

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.940
And the nineties was a
different time, you know?

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.117
- I feel like people used to
pluck all their eyebrows off

00:00:47.117 --> 00:00:48.030
at one point.

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:48.863
- That's true.

00:00:48.863 --> 00:00:50.460
- Yes, it was a very thin line.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.640
- I have very, I've
been told, not to brag,

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:56.910
but I've been told I
have very Irish eyebrows,

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:58.950
which means they're hardy.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.085
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:00.085 --> 00:01:01.920
- And yeah, they're kind of strong.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:02.831
- I do too.

00:01:02.831 --> 00:01:03.664
- Do you too?

00:01:03.664 --> 00:01:04.560
- Yeah, you have to pluck away.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:05.640
There's a carpet up here.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.690
- That's not a bad thing.

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.460
But yeah, in the nineties
it was kind of tough.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.950
Now everyone's like, you know

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:13.327
four day work week and do your
eyebrows however you want.

00:01:13.327 --> 00:01:14.160
It's amazing.

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:14.993
- Yeah.
- Again.

00:01:14.993 --> 00:01:15.826
- I love it.

00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:17.460
We're starting to turn
European with this whole, yeah.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:18.660
I love that vibe, yeah.

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:19.680
I feel like every time I go to Europe,

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:20.580
they're always on vacation.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.410
I'm like, why did I not grow up here?

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:23.280
I'm like what?

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:24.960
How are you still on vacation?

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.970
- You should do Kelly Clarkson in Europe.

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:28.860
And then the entire
week should be no shows.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:29.880
- We just sit around.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:30.713
- And you just have wine.

00:01:30.713 --> 00:01:33.210
- Will you come to that show
and just hang out with wine?

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.080
- And we walk around

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:35.820
and we film it just one
hour a day and you're like,

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:36.653
this is it.

00:01:36.653 --> 00:01:39.873
- We're in Europe and now siesta,
we're gonna go take a nap.

